For a requested full process explanation or implementation brief, use a Mermaid sequence or flow diagram when it helps show verified relationships. Include branches and response roles only when the selected source version supports them. A new site's SVG may be inspected, but its visual order alone does not prove decision logic. Add a field table when payload details are in scope. Skip diagrams for narrow lookups.
